Team,

Good afternoon!

Please be informed that YEC, Mr.Sakamoto approved the fabrication of
Thomson die by NODA KIGATA Philippines

Note: All expenses will be charged to YEC, Okayama c/o Mr. Sakamoto

For our common information and reference,

Thanks,
Erick.



